  "body": "The definitions of \"index Shift_JIS pointer\" and \" index Big5 pointer\" talk about excluding pointers. This is ambiguous, since it might be read to interpret as the corresponding code points getting treated as unmapped. For clarity, please say \"excluding entries whose pointers are in the range\" instead.\n",
